---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---

<Layout
 title="About Us & Methodology | Instant Typing"
 description="Discover the engineering philosophy, testing standards, and mathematical calculation algorithms behind Instant Typing."
 canonicalPath="/about"
>
 <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8 text-ds-text-primary ">
 <header class="border-b shadow-ds-border pb-6">
 <h1 class="text-ds-text-primary text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] leading-[1.1] text-balance" data-i18n="about.title">
 About Instant Typing
 </h1>
 <p class="font-normal text-pretty text-sm text-ds-text-secondary mt-2" data-i18n="about.subtitle">
 A modern, distraction-free typing platform built for speed, accuracy, and genuine skill growth.
 </p>
 </header>

 <section class="space-y-3">
 <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] leading-[1.2] text-balance text-ds-text-primary flex items-center gap-2"><Icon name="flag" class="w-5 h-5 text-sky-600 " /><span data-i18n="about.mission_heading">Our Mission</span></h2>
 <p class="font-normal text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-ds-text-secondary " data-i18n="about.mission_p1">
 Typing is the primary bridge between human thought and digital execution. Yet most typing test platforms on the web today are bloated with aggressive advertisements, laggy interfaces, confusing paywalls, and noisy gamification that distracts from deliberate practice.
 </p>
 <p class="font-normal text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-ds-text-secondary " data-i18n="about.mission_p2">
 Instant Typing was engineered to provide an ultra-clean, lightning-fast testing environment that respects your attention. Every millisecond of keystroke latency has been eliminated, allowing typists to focus purely on finger rhythm and muscle memory.
 </p>
 </section>

 <section class="space-y-3">
 <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] leading-[1.2] text-balance text-ds-text-primary flex items-center gap-2">
 <Icon name="verified-user" class="w-5 h-5 text-sky-600 " />
 <span data-i18n="about.built_heading">Honest, Distraction-Free Practice</span>
 </h2>
 <p class="font-normal text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-ds-text-secondary " data-i18n="about.built_p1">
 Instant Typing is a free typing test built for adults who are relearning typing for work. No signup, no ads while you type, and your results stay in your browser.
 </p>
 <p class="font-normal text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-ds-text-secondary " data-i18n="about.built_p2">
 It was built to be fast, distraction-free, and honest about what a score means — Net WPM, accuracy, and consistency, with the exact formulas on our <a href="/how-we-measure/" class="text-[#0072F5] hover:underline" data-i18n="about.how_we_measure_link">How We Measure page</a>.
 </p>
 </section>

 <section class="space-y-3">
 <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] leading-[1.2] text-balance text-ds-text-primary flex items-center gap-2"><Icon name="analytics" class="w-5 h-5 text-sky-600 " /><span data-i18n="about.diagnostics_heading">Built-In Diagnostics &amp; Remediation</span></h2>
 <p class="font-normal text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-ds-text-secondary " data-i18n="about.diagnostics_body">
 Unlike other platforms that simply show you a final number and ask you to try again, our engine logs your exact keystroke latencies and typo clusters. After every test, you receive an automated breakdown of your weakest keys and a 1-click option to train exclusively on the words you missed.
 </p>
 </section>

 <!-- Quick Test Navigation -->
 <nav aria-label="Explore typing tests" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 pt-4">
 <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg shadow-ds-border bg-ds-bg-100 text-sm font-medium text-ds-text-primary hover:border-[#0072F5] hover:text-[#0072F5] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#0072F5]">
 <Icon name="keyboard" class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0" />
 <span data-i18n="about.link_home">Main Typing Test</span>
 </a>
 <a href="/how-we-measure/" class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg shadow-ds-border bg-ds-bg-100 text-sm font-medium text-ds-text-primary hover:border-[#0072F5] hover:text-[#0072F5] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#0072F5]">
 <Icon name="analytics" class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0" />
 <span data-i18n="about.link_measure">How We Measure</span>
 </a>
 <a href="/wpm-calculator/" class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg shadow-ds-border bg-ds-bg-100 text-sm font-medium text-ds-text-primary hover:border-[#0072F5] hover:text-[#0072F5] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#0072F5]">
 <Icon name="timer" class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0" />
 <span data-i18n="about.link_calc">WPM Calculator</span>
 </a>
 </nav>
 </article>
</Layout>
